# Lockfiles are deliberately NOT ignored. This is an application, not a library: the exact
# dependency versions are part of what makes a build reproducible, and `npm ci` refuses to
# run without one. `package-lock.json` was ignored here from before there was any code,
# which broke CI's dependency cache and would have broken `npm ci` one step later.
#   Cargo.lock             committed
#   web/package-lock.json  committed
